===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|propertee}}, {{m|enm|properte}}, {{m|enm|propirte}}, {{m|enm|proprete}}, borrowed from {{der|en|xno|-}} and {{der|en|fro|propreté}}, {{m|fro|proprieté||propriety, fitness, property}}, from {{der|en|la|proprietās||a peculiarity, one's peculiar nature or quality, right or fact of possession, property}}, from {{m|la|proprius||special, particular, one's own}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|en|proper|ty}}. {{doublet|en|propriety}}.

